Subject: [PATCH 234/260] [ae-patch] Show a long approval answer as its first
 clause and wrap the plain option picker

A pop-up answer written as a sentence made a block of button text. The button now shows the words before the first colon (else a cut at a word) with the full text in its tooltip and accessible name, and the plain option picker gets the same wrap classes as the choice buttons so a long answer stays inside the card on a phone.
